248 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Meet the Charger \042\072 one dev board\054 one dead project\047s PCB\054 one rubber band\054 and a camera battery that finally gets to charge again\056 My friend\047s camera came with no charger\054 so I gave the Seeed XIAO nRF a new job\054 charging the NB\05511L straight off its built\055in LiPo circuit\056 Same 3\0567V chemistry\054 no extra parts needed\056 It\047s slow\056 It\047s chonky \042\056 It works\056)
